s/sigewinne/261111-225237/zh-3.webp","t":"content/genshin/builds/sigewinne/261111-225237/zh-3.t.webp","w":1080,"h":1350,"kind":"why","links":[{"n":"Silvershower Heartstrings","r":[0.1093,0.2474,0.0491,0.0393],"k":"w"},{"n":"Aqua Simulacra","r":[0.1093,0.3104,0.0491,0.0393],"k":"w"},{"n":"Elegy for the End","r":[0.1093,0.3733,0.0491,0.0393],"k":"w"},{"n":"Ocean-Hued Clam","r":[0.5231,0.2552,0.0491,0.0393],"k":"a"},{"n":"Song of Days Past","r":[0.5231,0.3259,0.0491,0.0393],"k":"a"},{"n":"Tenacity of the Millelith","r":[0.5231,0.3889,0.0491,0.0393],"k":"a"},{"n":"Sigewinne","r":[0.0815,0.5007,0.0389,0.0311]},{"n":"Furina","r":[0.1278,0.5007,0.0389,0.0311]},{"n":"Fischl","r":[0.1741,0.5007,0.0389,0.0311]},{"n":"Kaedehara Kazuha","r":[0.2204,0.5007,0.0389,0.0311]},{"n":"Sigewinne","r":[0.0815,0.5637,0.0389,0.0311]},{"n":"Kamisato Ayato","r":[0.1278,0.5637,0.0389,0.0311]},{"n":"Furina","r":[0.1741,0.5637,0.0389,0.0311]},{"n":"Kaedehara Kazuha","r":[0.2204,0.5637,0.0389,0.0311]},{"n":"Sigewinne","r":[0.0815,0.6267,0.0389,0.0311]},{"n":"Nilou","r":[0.1278,0.6267,0.0389,0.0311]},{"n":"Nahida","r":[0.1741,0.6267,0.0389,0.0311]},{"n":"Xingqiu","r":[0.2204,0.6267,0.0389,0.0311]},{"n":"Sigewinne","r":[0.0815,0.6896,0.0389,0.0311]},{"n":"Yoimiya","r":[0.1278,0.6896,0.0389,0.0311]},{"n":"Furina","r":[0.1741,0.6896,0.0389,0.0311]},{"n":"Zhongli","r":[0.2204,0.6896,0.0389,0.0311]}]}]}},"thumb":"content/genshin/builds/sigewinne/261111-225237/en-1.t.webp","why":{"w":[{"name":"Silvershower Heartstrings","text":"Huge HP% boosts healing and her off-field Skill buff; the passive aids her Burst DMG."},{"name":"Aqua Simulacra","text":"HP% passive and CD boost her personal DMG, especially when her Burst is used."},{"name":"Elegy for the End","text":"ER plus team ATK and EM buffs once its sigils are stacked."},{"name":"Sequence of Solitude","text":"41.3% HP at level 90 boosts healing and her Skill buff."},{"name":"Recurve Bow","text":"46.9% HP at level 90 is excellent for healing and her Skill buff; its defeat-heal passive is minor."},{"name":"Favonius Warbow","text":"Provides Energy Recharge and team particles from on-field CRIT hits. When allies need energy; build enough CRIT Rate to trigger it."},{"name":"Sacrificial Bow","text":"Can reset her Skill for extra healing, Hydro application, and another set of buff stacks. Costs additional field time; reset requires a Skill hit. Higher refinements improve consistency."}],"a":[{"names":["Ocean-Hued Clam"],"text":"Converts her frequent healing into extra Physical bubble DMG, even when teammates are healthy.","stats":"HP% · HP% · HP%"},{"names":["Song of Days Past"],"text":"Converts healing into a flat DMG bonus for teammates.","stats":"HP% · HP% · HP%"},{"names":["Tenacity of the Millelith"],"text":"Her Skill hits can provide an ATK buff for several seconds.","stats":"HP% · HP% · HP%"}],"t":[{"name":"Bubble Taser","members":["Sigewinne","Furina","Fischl","Kaedehara Kazuha"],"text":"Sigewinne heals for Furina Fanfare and buffs off-field Skill hits from Furina and Fischl; Kazuha groups and shreds resistance.","roles":["Healer / Buffer","Off-field DPS / Buffer","Off-field DPS / Battery","Buffer / Debuffer"]},{"name":"House Call","members":["Sigewinne","Kamisato Ayato","Furina","Kaedehara Kazuha"],"text":"Ayato drives Hydro damage while Furina buffs and attacks off-field. Sigewinne sustains Fanfare and buffs Furina’s Skill hits.","roles":["Healer / Buffer","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Buffer","Buffer / Debuffer"]},{"name":"Bloom Ward","members":["Sigewinne","Nilou","Nahida","Xingqiu"],"text":"Nilou enables Bountiful Cores; Nahida supplies Dendro while Xingqiu drives Hydro application. Sigewinne keeps the team healthy.","roles":["Healer / Buffer","Bloom Buffer / Hydro Enabler","Dendro Enabler / Buffer","Off-field DPS / Hydro Enabler"]},{"name":"Fireworks Clinic","members":["Sigewinne","Yoimiya","Furina","Zhongli"],"text":"Furina and Sigewinne provide Hydro for some Vaporizes; Sigewinne heals Furina’s HP drain while Zhongli protects Yoimiya.","roles":["Healer / Buffer","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Buffer","Shielder / Debuffer"]}],"v":"Furina Partner: Ocean-Hued Clam or Song of Days Past; focus HP to strengthen healing and Furina Fanfare.\nBurst Quickswap: Use Emblem, ER/HP% sands and damage stats only when her Burst fits the rotation.\nATK Buffer: Tenacity can buff ATK when Skill hits connect; useful if no teammate already carries it.\nBudget Healer: Recurve Bow and HP% main stats supply strong healing without premium weapons.","n":3},"seo":{"roles":["Healer / Support"],"about":"Sigewinne is an HP-scaling Hydro healer whose Skill restores the team and boosts limited instances of off-field Elemental Skill damage. She pairs especially well with Furina. Her Hydro application is modest, and most healer builds skip her costly Burst to save field time.","pros":["Strong teamwide healing","Boosts off-field Skill hits","Excellent Furina partner","Simple healer rotation"],"cons":["Limited Hydro application","Buff stacks are limited","High HP goal for full buff","Burst takes field time"],"weapons":["Silvershower Heartstrings","Aqua Simulacra","Elegy for the End","Sequence of Solitude","Recurve Bow","Favonius Warbow","Sacrificial Bow","Jade Vista"],"arts":[{"sets":["Ocean-Hued Clam"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Best"},{"sets":["Song of Days Past"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""},{"sets":["Tenacity of the Millelith"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""}],"main":["HP% / Energy Recharge","HP%","HP%"],"stats":["HP: 50,000 - 65,000 (65k caps A1)","Energy Recharge: 100% - 120% (no Burst)","Energy Recharge: 155% - 220% (Burst)","CRIT Rate: 45% - 60% (Favonius)"],"vars":[{"title":"Furina Fanfare Partner","role":"Healer","weapons":["Silvershower Heartstrings","Sequence of Solitude","Recurve Bow"],"arts":[{"sets":["Song of Days Past"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Ocean-Hued Clam"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"HP% / HP% / HP%; ignore Burst ER if not casting Burst.","teams":"Furina plus off-field Skill damage dealers.","when":"Use Sigewinne’s Skill to restore team HP after Furina drains it and support Fanfare generation.","cond":"Furina healing synergy; off-field Skill damage buff has limited stacks.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Quickswap Burst Damage","role":"Sub DPS","weapons":["Aqua Simulacra","Silvershower Heartstrings","Elegy for the End"],"arts":[{"sets":["Emblem of Severed Fate"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Prioritize enough ER for Burst, then HP%, Hydro DMG and CRIT.","teams":"A quickswap team with time for her Burst; preferably double Hydro.","when":"Add her Burst during downtime for personal Hydro damage, rather than spending all her field time on healing.","cond":"High energy needs; generally weaker than healer-focused builds at C0.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Tenacity ATK Buffer","role":"Support","weapons":["Silvershower Heartstrings","Sequence of Solitude","Recurve Bow"],"arts":[{"sets":["Tenacity of the Millelith"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"HP% / HP% / HP%; Energy Recharge only if Burst is used.","teams":"An ATK-scaling carry; no competing Tenacity holder.","when":"Use Skill hits to trigger Tenacity’s team ATK buff; less useful for HP-scaling or reaction-damage carries.","cond":"Buff is not permanent and depends on Skill hits.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Accessible HP Healer","role":"Healer","weapons":["Recurve Bow","Sequence of Solitude","Favonius Warbow"],"arts":[{"sets":["Ocean-Hued Clam"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Song of Days Past"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Stack HP%; with Favonius, add CRIT Rate and consider ER.","teams":"Any team needing reliable healing; especially useful alongside Furina.","when":"A low-cost build that gets strong team healing and off-field Skill buffs without her signature weapon.","cond":"Sequence of Solitude requires ownership from a past event.","notes":"","pre":false}],"mats":["Varunada Lazurite Sliver","Varunada Lazurite Fragment","Varunada Lazurite Chunk","Varunada Lazurite Gemstone","Water That Failed To Transcend","Teachi